DejaVu Sans font family (Regular, Bold, Italic, BoldItalic)

Vendored here for embedding in generated PDF reports (roadmap Phase 5,
feature 7). DejaVu fonts are derived from the Bitstream Vera fonts and are
released under a permissive license explicitly allowing redistribution,
modification, and embedding in documents/software, provided copyright
notices are retained. Full text: https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html

